LAMMPS (29 Aug 2024 - Update 1)
# Minimization of Sigma29 disconnections using LAMMPS
#------------------General settings for simulation----------------------------
clear
units metal
dimension 3
boundary m p p
atom_style atomic
neighbor 0.3 bin
neigh_modify delay 5
atom_modify map array sort 0 0.0

#----------------- Variable declaration---------------------------------------
variable a equal 3.615
variable potpath string /opt/homebrew/Cellar/lammps/20240829-update1/share/lammps/potentials/Cu_mishin1.eam.alloy
variable sigma equal 29
variable y_image equal 6
variable dispy equal 0.0
variable dispz equal -0.45
variable elem string Cu
variable mis equal 44.0
variable folder string output/Cu/Sigma29/Misorientation44.0/size6/b2.01h-2.35/
variable file_name string ${folder}data.Cus29.0inc0.0_size6disc12
variable file_name string output/Cu/Sigma29/Misorientation44.0/size6/b2.01h-2.35/data.Cus29.0inc0.0_size6disc12
variable out_file1 string ${folder}data.Cus29.0inc0.0_size6disc12_min
variable out_file1 string output/Cu/Sigma29/Misorientation44.0/size6/b2.01h-2.35/data.Cus29.0inc0.0_size6disc12_min
variable out_file_mov string ${folder}data.Cus29.0inc0.0_size6disc12_minmov
variable out_file_mov string output/Cu/Sigma29/Misorientation44.0/size6/b2.01h-2.35/data.Cus29.0inc0.0_size6disc12_minmov

#----------------------- Atomic structure ----------------------
lattice fcc $a
lattice fcc 3.615
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 3.615 3.615 3.615
read_data ${file_name}
read_data output/Cu/Sigma29/Misorientation44.0/size6/b2.01h-2.35/data.Cus29.0inc0.0_size6disc12
Reading data file ...
  triclinic box = (-100.1 -116.80412 -3.615) to (100.1 116.80412 3.615) with tilt (0 0 0)
  2 by 3 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  28560 atoms
  read_data CPU = 0.129 seconds
group upper type 1
14640 atoms in group upper
group lower type 2
13920 atoms in group lower

#----------------------- InterAtomic Potential --------------------
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ${potpath} Cu Cu
pair_coeff * * /opt/homebrew/Cellar/lammps/20240829-update1/share/lammps/potentials/Cu_mishin1.eam.alloy Cu Cu
Reading eam/alloy potential file /opt/homebrew/Cellar/lammps/20240829-update1/share/lammps/potentials/Cu_mishin1.eam.alloy with DATE: 2007-10-12
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 10 check yes

#-------------------- Define compute settings ------------------------
compute csym all centro/atom fcc
compute energy all pe/atom
compute eng all reduce sum c_energy

#---------- Displace top part for lowest energy structure ----------
delete_atoms overlap 1 upper upper
System init for delete_atoms ...
Neighbor list info ...
  update: every = 1 steps, delay = 10 steps, check = yes
  max neighbors/atom: 2000, page size: 100000
  master list distance cutoff = 7.50679
  ghost atom cutoff = 7.50679
  binsize = 3.753395, bins = 54 63 2
  3 neighbor lists, perpetual/occasional/extra = 1 2 0
  (1) command delete_atoms, occasional
      attributes: full, newton on
      pair build: full/bin/atomonly
      stencil: full/bin/3d
      bin: standard
  (2) pair eam/alloy, perpetual
      attributes: half, newton on
      pair build: half/bin/atomonly/newton/tri
      stencil: half/bin/3d/tri
      bin: standard
  (3) compute centro/atom, occasional
      attributes: full, newton on
      pair build: full/bin/atomonly
      stencil: full/bin/3d
      bin: standard
